@baseUrl = https://localhost:5001
@accessToken = <Supabase access token>
@lobbyId = <room id returned by create>
@invitationCode = <invitation code returned by create>

### Create a private lobby (host is assigned South)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/multiplayer/lobbies
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "maximumHumanPlayers": 4,
  "eastBot": "random",
  "northBot": "expert",
  "westBot": "master"
}

### Read the lobby (member only; reconnect uses the same request)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/multiplayer/lobbies/{{lobbyId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Join with an invitation and choose a free absolute seat
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/multiplayer/lobbies/{{lobbyId}}/join
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "invitationCode": "{{invitationCode}}",
  "seat": "East"
}

### Mark this authenticated member ready, or set false to revoke readiness
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/multiplayer/lobbies/{{lobbyId}}/ready
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "isReady": true
}

### Host only; requires two or more human members and all members ready
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/multiplayer/lobbies/{{lobbyId}}/start
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
